   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **#Blue Skies**: back after 86 archived shows (498 days); rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **^Crawdad Hole**: rare: 6 archived performances [4]\n- **Katy Daly**: back after 68 archived shows (446 days); rare: 8 archived performances [4]\n- **$Jazz Odyssey Volume 6**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **%Old Groundhog**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **!Boulderdash**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **&Thunder**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **~If Your Hair Is Too Long, There's Sin In Your Heart**: rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-02-23** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 148 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Billy [1]\n- Z-Man's recording of this Nashville Bridgestone Arena show is labeled show number 58 of 2024, from Team Dirty South and Home Team [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-02-23**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II at 48kHz/32-bit, then processed and converted to 16-bit FLAC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Bridgestone Arena - Nashville, TN - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/2024-02-24-venue-tba-nashville-tn/) [5]",
